msgid "To get it, and later versions, with your system's updates, set up the OpenCRT package repository once: kimp0ssible-no.github.io/OpenCRT"
msgstr "Norėdami gauti šią ir vėlesnes versijas kartu su sistemos naujinimais, vieną kartą nustatykite OpenCRT paketų saugyklą: kimp0ssible-no.github.io/OpenCRT"

msgid "Download the portable zip from the release page and replace the program files in this folder; the settings folder stays as it is."
